      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Clean 2D anime illustration. Begin with the exact young woman, hairstyle, white shirt, dark tie, pleated skirt, tights, seated pose, classroom window, and daylight shown in <Picture 1>. In one continuous shot she lowers her legs from the desk, plants her feet, and stands up. The young woman (S1), in a clear, gentle Japanese voice with a bright, slightly nervous tone and a natural conversational pace, looks toward the camera and says: <d>[Japanese] ねえ、ちょっとだけ聞いてくれる？</d> She takes a few steps toward the camera while maintaining her identity, outfit, and the classroom setting, and continues softly with a shy smile: <d>[Japanese] ずっと言えなかったんだけど、</d> As she reaches a closer framing, she looks directly into the lens, makes a small finger-heart with her thumb and index finger beside her face, and says with rising excitement: <d>[Japanese] 君のことが、好きなの！</d> She lowers her hand, her cheeks flush, and she glances away to the side, covering her mouth lightly with her fingertips, then says quickly in a flustered, embarrassed voice: <d>[Japanese] あ、今の、聞かなかったことにしてもいいよ？</d> Her mouth moves in sync with every exact line, and she ends with an embarrassed smile, still glancing to the side.\n\noverall_soundscape: Light classroom ambience continues under the soft sounds of her feet landing and footsteps approaching the camera. Her clothes rustle gently as she stands, raises her hand, and moves her arms, with a small nervous breath between her lines.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
